.TH DISCORDO 1 "2024-07-16" "Discordo Manual" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
discordo \- A lightweight, terminal-based Discord client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B discordo
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discordo is a lightweight, terminal-based Discord client with keyboard-focused navigation and markdown support.
.SH CONFIGURATION OPTIONS
.SS General Settings
.TP
.B mouse = true
Enable/disable mouse support
.TP
.B editor = "default"
Program to open when editing messages (uses $EDITOR when set to "default")
.TP
.B status = "default"
User status: "default", "online", "dnd", "idle", "invisible", or "offline"
.TP
.B markdown = true
Enable/disable markdown parsing in messages
.TP
.B autocomplete_limit = 20
Number of autocomplete suggestions (0 to disable)
.TP
.B messages_limit = 50
Number of messages to load per channel (0-100)
.SS Timestamps
.TP
.B enabled = true
Show message timestamps
.TP
.B format = "3:04PM"
Timestamp format (Go time layout)
.SS Notifications
.TP
.B enabled = true
Enable/disable notifications
.TP
.B duration = 0
Notification sound duration (0 for default)
.TP
.B sound.enabled = true
Enable/disable notification sounds
.TP
.B sound.only_on_ping = true
Only play sound on direct mentions
.SH KEYBINDINGS
.SS Global Shortcuts
.TP
.B Ctrl+G
Focus guilds (servers) tree
.TP
.B Ctrl+T
Focus messages list
.TP
.B Ctrl+Space
Focus message input
.TP
.B Ctrl+B
Toggle guilds tree visibility
.TP
.B Ctrl+C
Quit application
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Log out and remove authentication token
.SS Guilds Tree Navigation
.TP
.B k
Select previous guild/channel
.TP
.B j
Select next guild/channel
.TP
.B g
Select first guild/channel
.TP
.B G
Select last guild/channel
.TP
.B Enter
Select channel or expand guild
.TP
.B i
Yank (copy) guild/channel ID
.TP
.B -
Collapse parent node
.TP
.B p
Move to parent node
.SS Messages List Navigation
.TP
.B k
Select previous message
.TP
.B j
Select next message
.TP
.B g
Select first message
.TP
.B G
Select last message
.TP
.B s
Select message reference (reply)
.TP
.B r
Reply to selected message
.TP
.B R
Reply with mention to selected message
.TP
.B Esc
Cancel selection
.TP
.B D
Delete selected message (with confirmation)
.TP
.B d
Delete selected message
.TP
.B o
Open attachments/links in default browser
.TP
.B y
Yank message content
.TP
.B u
Yank message URL
.TP
.B i
Yank message ID
.SS Message Input
.TP
.B Ctrl+V
Paste from clipboard (text/images)
.TP
.B Enter
Send message
.TP
.B Esc
Clear input or cancel reply
.TP
.B Tab
Complete username mentions
.TP
.B Ctrl+E
Open external editor
.TP
\fBCtrl+\\\fP
Open file picker
.SS Mentions List
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Move selection up
.TP
.B Ctrl+N
Move selection down
.SH THEME CUSTOMIZATION
.SS Title Bar
.TP
.B alignment = "left"
Title alignment: "left", "center", or "right"
.SS Border
.TP
.B enabled = true
Enable/disable border
.TP
.B padding = [0, 0, 1, 1]
Border padding [top, bottom, left, right]
.TP
.B normal_set = "round"
Inactive border style
.TP
.B active_set = "round"
Active border style
.SS Guilds Tree
.TP
.B auto_expand_folders = true
Automatically expand folder nodes
.TP
.B graphics = true
Show tree graphics
.SS Messages List
.TP
.B reply_indicator = ">"
Character indicating replies
.TP
.B forwarded_indicator = "<"
Character indicating forwarded messages
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/discordo/config.toml
Configuration file location
.SH SEE ALSO
.TP
.B discord.com
Official Discord website
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at the Discordo GitHub repository
.SH AUTHOR
Discordo development team
